1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,021
I get up at seven o'clock every morning
我每天早上七点起床

2
00:00:02,436 --> 00:00:04,301
I brush my teeth and wash my face
我刷牙洗脸

3
00:00:04,956 --> 00:00:07,022
After I eat breakfast with my family
等我和家人吃完早餐

4
00:00:07,277 --> 00:00:09,301
I go to school and learn many things
我上学学了很多东西

5
00:00:09,795 --> 00:00:10,557
During recess
在休庭期间

6
00:00:10,557 --> 00:00:11,942
I play with my friends
我和我的朋友一起玩

7
00:00:12,035 --> 00:00:12,797
After school
放学后

8
00:00:12,797 --> 00:00:14,461
I go home and do my homework
我回家做作业

9
00:00:14,737 --> 00:00:15,480
In the evening
傍晚时分

10
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:17,062
I eat dinner with my family
我和家人一起吃晚饭

11
00:00:17,317 --> 00:00:20,222
I start to sleep at nine o'clock to be ready for a new day
我九点开始睡觉为新的一天做好准备

